==Battleground==
*1 [[Selena]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunny Celeboodle]] spawns after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the lack of support, Selena will have a hard time advancing as long as you never stop meatshielding. If you do just that, your ranged attackers ([[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]], long-ranged [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]], etc.) are bound to kill her given enough time. Once Selena is defeated, Sunny Celeboodle will be an easy kill.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Never Not Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Not Summer!]] stages, Cats of Yesterday's Japanese name, Neko no Hi no 1993 ("Cat Day 1993") is a reference to a song, in this case "[https://youtu.be/Kj57YmedrlI Natsu no Hi no 1993]" ("Summer Day 1993") by [[wikipedia:ja:class (音楽グループ)|class]].

